WEBVTT

00:16:27.607 --> 00:16:30.110
And that hurts me.

00:16:31.611 --> 00:16:37.242
And when you give birth to a child,

00:16:37.284 --> 00:16:41.288
when a human being is coming
out of your body,

00:16:41.329 --> 00:16:42.998
everything changes.

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:46.043
Priorities,

00:16:46.084 --> 00:16:47.377
what matters,

00:16:47.377 --> 00:16:49.921
you learn to go to the core of things.

00:16:51.006 --> 00:16:54.509
What I want people to remember is that

00:16:54.509 --> 00:16:58.096
you can fall beneath the Earth.

00:16:59.097 --> 00:17:01.141
But you always can rise.